      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "\"I found Viktor Vaughn the next morning, nearly frozen to death\"",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "A",
      "rhyme_vowel": "A"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Party people know the name",
          "rhyme": "am",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Vik with a \"K\", it fits all the same",
          "rhyme": "am",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "If it ain't don't bother",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Told the little monster, \"No I ain't your father",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "It's Uncle Viktor, shut the lights—I'm gettin' dizzy",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "And close the door—can't you see your momma busy?\"",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "What a scoundrel",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Gassed up the town fool to go rob the crown jewel",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "He's like a lego megalomaniac",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Who's into electronic and techno, a real brainiac",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Smack-dab in the hip-hop gold rush",
          "rhyme": "9S",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "V, rather the old stuff, preferably the Cold Crush",
          "rhyme": "9S",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "It gets deeper than Deepak Chopra",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Except he keep a stack and some cheap-ass vodka",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Kneecap popper, only when he miss the chewy center",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "At least he always hits who he meant ta",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Remember he got a short fuse and bad temper",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "And a plan to claim emperor by December",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "Member of the most player-hated race",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "Who made this invaded place and stated with a straight face",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "\"If I cut her off I might miss her",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "But one of these days—right in the kisser!\"",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "She probably get mad at me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "I bet ya it gets her nowhere like flattery",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "She said, \"Where were you last Saturday?",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "And don't lie—we got your fingerprints off the battery",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "Don't make me have to bling you",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "Or see you in the street and double team you with the emu\"",
          "rhyme": "y",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "He told her, \"When the gem paper tear off",
          "rhyme": "Of",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "It'll probably tear her ear off before y'all even square off\"",
          "rhyme": "Of",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "No good good-for-nothin'",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "Kill her high for no frill like 'Good Will Huntin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "He feels out of place like Bizarro",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "Feisty chick, comes all out her face like Charo",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "It's Vaughn, he's back on",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "And you know he don't care like Jimmy Crack Corn",
          "rhyme": "ORn",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "Wax off, wax on",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "37",
          "text": "Tried to raise taxes on cracks and black porn",
          "rhyme": "ORn",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "38",
          "text": "Another year passes",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "39",
          "text": "Gone are the days when he used to wear glasses",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "40",
          "text": "Now he wear contacts",
          "rhyme": "akt",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "41",
          "text": "Unfrozen caveman look over the contracts",
          "rhyme": "akt",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "42",
          "text": "These crews is too soft",
          "rhyme": "Oft",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "43",
          "text": "He came to tear the roof off to get paid to goof off",
          "rhyme": "Of",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "44",
          "text": "They don't really wanna battle",
          "rhyme": "abl",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "45",
          "text": "All they gon' do is get mad and go tattle",
          "rhyme": "abl",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "46",
          "text": "Tell 'em the retard said it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "47",
          "text": "He ripped up the WE CARD sign and jetted",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "48",
          "text": "You gotta give his three card credit",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "49",
          "text": "Even though at times he can be hard-headed",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "50",
          "text": "Yeah, the main theme",
          "rhyme": "izm",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "51",
          "text": "Cream by all means, and harebrained schemes",
          "rhyme": "am",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "52",
          "text": "The lord's performance was flawless",
          "rhyme": "Es",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "53",
          "text": "He rocked with a crown and a Bobby Brown cordless",
          "rhyme": "Es",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "54",
          "text": "The broad he was with was gorgeous",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "55",
          "text": "The only flaw he saw was she cause a nigga more stress",
          "rhyme": "Es",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "56",
          "text": "Not tryin' to diss her",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "57",
          "text": "But I used to know this sister that could put a whole fist in her",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "58",
          "text": "Hell, I made it, Momma",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "59",
          "text": "Grammy for the world's most celebrated rhymer",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "60",
          "text": "Dead the drama, scama",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "61",
          "text": "Four Gs of pizzy from Bahama",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "62",
          "text": "V, the lead brown man",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "63",
          "text": "And never count your chickens before you read SoundScan",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "64",
          "text": "What about Mom and Pops?",
          "rhyme": "Op",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "65",
          "text": "They might as well cooperate and wait til the bomb drop",
          "rhyme": "Op",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "66",
          "text": "Get more cabbage",
