          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "67",
          "text": "Often time he wonder how they get so savage",
          "rhyme": "aZ",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "68",
          "text": "V—not your average",
          "rhyme": "aZ",
